ation of the plane that passes through the point $E(4,-2,5)$ and is parallel to the lines $r=⟨11,0,5⟩+s⟨7,-3,4⟩$ and $r=⟨12,-2,4⟩+t⟨3,-5,1⟩.$" :question/worked-solution "The direction vectors of the lines are ${v}_{1}=⟨7,-3,4⟩$ and ${v}_{2}=⟨3,-5,1⟩$, respectively. These vectors are parallel to the plane but not to each other.\n\nWe also know that the point $E(4,-2,5)$ lies on the plane and its position vector is $e=⟨4,-2,5⟩.$  \n\nSo, the corresponding parametric equation of the plane is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r & =e+s{v}_{1}+t{v}_{2} \\\\ r & =⟨4,-2,5⟩+s⟨7,-3,4⟩+t⟨3,-5,1⟩,\\,s,t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-128538/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "3061cb06-f57f-57c8-8821-dbd962b1e78e"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-128538"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-128743/selection/6bf7b3f5b5c5f8d867a7be43abd1894bf3f9083079ca10369364c79a887b7ae7" :answer/id #uuid "0cc3ceb4-3bf2-56c1-af8b-8474e22b53a9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "r=⟨7,-2,3⟩+s⟨-3,6,-7⟩+t⟨-4,9,3⟩,\\,s,t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-128743/selection/b1b07b7bc9ffe643e175368dc9ea889e4663771740a0cdc69b8d58d1cfea0373" :answer/id #uuid "39afe7ab-83b5-5a72-8e2f-2b0fc287778c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "r=⟨7,-2,3⟩+s⟨-3,7,-6⟩+t⟨-4,3,9⟩,\\,s,t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-128743/selection/802e19769099e353f0ead80022d65039acc6554f858394f663db17529f61144b" :answer/id #uuid "1c1c14d9-943a-5f8a-9bf9-56ab7f5a98ee" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "r=⟨7,-2,3⟩+s⟨3,7,-6⟩+t⟨-4,3,9⟩,\\,s,t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-128743/selection/738dc9fc101fa72c98be3826a2ea767e23a7dc1c2f2ea1fd262d63167958ce35" :answer/id #uuid "5facd0d9-6c14-580e-98d9-8c3a1540c055" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "r